      "domain_statement": "The fitted incompressible kinetic energy curves are reported for quench durations from 10^2 to 10^3, as evidenced by the reviewer figure transcription. The source also states the vortex scaling holds for 10 <= tau_Q <= 1000, but the energy fits are only supported on [100,1000].",
