      "definition": "Total incompressible kinetic energy at equilibration time, defined as E_i = (1/2) integral |u_i(r, t_eq)|^2 d^2r = integral_0^infty E_i(k) dk, where u_i is the incompressible component of the density-weighted velocity field.",
